ut while you flee from monstrous creatures.\n\nWith an immersive atmosphere, terrifying sound design, and unpredictable monster AI, every match is a new nightmare waiting to unfold. Whether you\u2019re playing with friends or braving the horror alone, this game will keep you on the edge of your seat. Will you escape, or will the monsters catch you first?\n\nPrepare for a fast-paced, fear-inducing adventure unlike anything you\u2019ve played before. Run, hide, survive\u2026 and don\u2019t look back!v", "short_description": "Game Is Purly Based Off of another game named \"Gorilla Tag\" Made by Another Axiom"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/nitrotag/pvtpolices", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "jay317jayofficial", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/nitrotag", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1023770785722696"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "CO_OP"], "id": "9374307232662701"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2215012238893098"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "2215012238893098"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1741482060, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2215012238893098"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binar